# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# cargo-fuzz artifacts (the fuzz crate is outside the workspace)
/fuzz/target
/fuzz/corpus
/fuzz/artifacts
/fuzz/coverage

# Coverage / profiling output
*.profraw
*.profdata
/coverage

# Editor / IDE files
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/settings.local.json
*.swp
*~

# Python bytecode cache (spec-mirror regeneration scripts)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local AV2 scratch streams (do not commit sample bitstreams)
/scratch
*.av2
*.obu
# ...but DO track the curated test fixtures.
!/tests/fixtures/*.av2
# ...and the committed conformance corpus vectors (CONF-AVM-VALID-STREAMS):
# `.ivf` vectors are already tracked (`.ivf` is not in the globs above), but
# future `.obu`/`.av2` corpus vectors would otherwise be excluded by them.
!/tests/conformance/**

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is intentionally committed (this repo builds binaries).
